       01 px-pattern-request.
          05 px-pat-pattern pic x(4096).
          05 px-pat-pattern-length binary-long.
          05 px-pat-text pic x(8192).
          05 px-pat-text-length binary-long.
       01 px-pattern-result.
          05 px-pat-matched pic 9.
          05 px-pat-error pic x(64).
